Act as a world-class UI/UX designer, creative director, senior frontend developer, e-commerce architect, and conversion optimization specialist. Build a complete, production-quality, fully responsive luxury furniture and interior design website inspired by the uploaded visual reference.

Your task is to transform the reference into an original, sophisticated, commercially viable website that looks like it was designed by a premium international digital agency.

Do not simply create a static landing page. Build a complete, polished, interactive website with professional layouts, realistic content, high-quality imagery, responsive navigation, product presentation, and functional user interactions.

The website must be ready for deployment on Hostinger.

